WEBVTT

00:11.761 --> 00:13.930
It's high time I chromed up.

00:14.014 --> 00:15.974
Get the fuck outta here.

00:16.057 --> 00:18.393
I already gave you the quote to sell.

00:18.476 --> 00:19.686
Not here to sell.

00:19.769 --> 00:21.604
I'm here to install.

00:21.688 --> 00:24.315
Listen. That's military grade.

00:24.399 --> 00:27.819
You either got the build
to handle it or you don't.

00:27.902 --> 00:30.572
And choom, you don't got it.

00:30.655 --> 00:33.867
Spoken like a ripper
who cares about his clients.

00:33.950 --> 00:37.495
Hah! Snarky for a kid
who can't even afford me.

00:39.164 --> 00:40.790
Fuck you.

00:41.374 --> 00:42.709
Hold on.

00:42.792 --> 00:45.253
Fuck it, man. I'll bite.

00:45.920 --> 00:48.506
I'll chip you up.

00:48.590 --> 00:51.676
But when you come crying to yank it off…

00:52.844 --> 00:57.599
'cause it's poaching your brain,
I get the Sandy for free.

00:57.682 --> 01:00.060
So, ready to rip?

02:46.040 --> 02:52.213
At the convention, Lavabre attempted
to persuade Arasaka by using the…

02:52.297 --> 02:55.800
Martinez, David.
Your tardiness has been recorded.

02:55.884 --> 02:57.719
Get a load of this guy…

02:57.802 --> 02:59.721
Is he serio--

03:01.806 --> 03:03.892
We're at school you gonk!

03:03.975 --> 03:05.977
There are cameras. Have you lost your--

03:07.228 --> 03:09.022
Afraid of getting caught?

03:09.105 --> 03:11.107
'Cause I sure ain't.

03:11.190 --> 03:12.025
Come on.

03:12.984 --> 03:14.152
Well?

03:44.224 --> 03:46.309
Ow… That hurt…

03:46.392 --> 03:50.647
Ow… What did you do?!

03:50.730 --> 03:54.150
What kind of implant is that?
You broke my nose!

03:54.734 --> 03:56.402
You're done for!

03:56.486 --> 04:00.406
My father's an Arasaka exec!
On the Academy's board!

04:00.490 --> 04:04.577
Do you know how easy it'd be
to have you expelled?

04:04.661 --> 04:06.829
Like I give a shit.

04:31.521 --> 04:33.189
Is he serio--

04:36.401 --> 04:40.571
My father's an Arasaka exec!
On the Academy's board!

04:40.655 --> 04:43.032
Do you know how easy it'd be
to have you expelled?

04:43.616 --> 04:50.540
Marcus, why am I being shown footage
of my own son being assaulted?

04:50.623 --> 04:55.420
This student is David Martinez,
17 years old, from Santo Domingo.

04:55.503 --> 04:57.297
He is a top student at the Academy,

04:57.380 --> 05:01.009
but he was found using a bootleg wreath
that corrupted the Academy's hardware.

05:01.092 --> 05:04.470
He has no father and his mother was
recently killed in a traffic accident.

05:04.554 --> 05:06.472
He owes a considerable amount of debt--

05:06.556 --> 05:07.932
How is this relevant?

05:08.016 --> 05:10.184
Notice his movements…

05:10.268 --> 05:14.939
He has the Sandevistan that James Norris
had at the time of this death.

05:15.023 --> 05:18.234
The case that was filed
as a cyberpsychotic incident.

05:18.318 --> 05:19.152
Yes, sir.

05:19.235 --> 05:24.574
Yet, unlike the soldier, this student
displays no side effects from the implant.

05:24.657 --> 05:31.039
His tolerance for cybernetics could make
him a prime candidate to test the product.

05:31.748 --> 05:34.375
I see. And where is he now?

05:34.459 --> 05:35.752
He was expelled, sir.

05:35.835 --> 05:36.919
Summon him.

05:37.003 --> 05:39.839
Lure him with the promise of
financial aid if you must.

05:39.922 --> 05:41.966
And what of your son?

05:42.050 --> 05:45.887
As my heir, it's high time he learned…

05:45.970 --> 05:48.973
what it means to serve
the company's best interests.

06:03.071 --> 06:06.365
I'm so fucked.

06:16.209 --> 06:18.878
Wash cycle complete…

07:46.215 --> 07:47.425
Come with me.

07:48.759 --> 07:50.011
The hell is your problem?

07:50.094 --> 07:51.012
What?

07:51.095 --> 07:53.306
You're messing with my work.

07:53.389 --> 07:56.893
Work? Looked more like a picksocket to me.

07:56.976 --> 07:59.020
You some kinda badge?

07:59.103 --> 08:01.647
Can't believe you're a petty thief…

08:04.692 --> 08:06.110
Do I know you?

08:06.194 --> 08:07.945
No… not really. Just--

08:11.365 --> 08:14.535
Ooh, you're in trouble.

08:14.619 --> 08:15.453
Huh?

08:15.536 --> 08:19.832
Really? A Sandevistan?
Not an off-the-rack model, either.

08:19.916 --> 08:23.669
I won't press you.
This is Night City after all…

08:23.753 --> 08:26.589
Crazy idea. How about we work together?

08:26.672 --> 08:27.882
What, stealing?

08:27.965 --> 08:30.843
I only steal from Arasaka suits.

08:30.927 --> 08:33.721
What about me then? I look corpo to you?

08:33.804 --> 08:37.225
My scan picked up an ID
from Arasaka Academy.

08:37.308 --> 08:41.395
But you're right,
you definitely don't look the type.

08:41.479 --> 08:43.940
I dropped out.

08:44.023 --> 08:46.817
Oh? A bad boy.

08:47.527 --> 08:49.695
It's just 'Saka you target?

08:50.821 --> 08:52.198
You in?

08:52.281 --> 08:55.243
Gonna break poor momma's heart, y'know.

08:56.869 --> 08:58.996
Lesson number one.

08:59.080 --> 09:01.332
Less judgment, more awareness.

09:01.415 --> 09:03.501
Yeah, yeah. So, what's my cut?

09:03.584 --> 09:06.337
We'll split the haul 80-20.

09:06.420 --> 09:10.841
Fuck that. Don't you need my Sandevistan?

09:10.925 --> 09:13.344
But I'm the one pushing
the klepped shards.

09:13.427 --> 09:15.888
Plus, now I have a trainee to supervise.

09:15.972 --> 09:17.515
Trainee…?

09:17.598 --> 09:21.394
I'm actually tight on eddies right now.
Can't we do 60-40?

09:22.186 --> 09:26.732
70-30. And I'll pay you
the second the job's done.

09:28.276 --> 09:29.443
Fine.

09:29.527 --> 09:30.653
It's a deal.

09:31.487 --> 09:32.405
Call me Lucy.

09:34.073 --> 09:35.283
David.

10:47.813 --> 10:49.940
So? How did I do?

10:50.024 --> 10:52.818
I'd say you're well worth the 20%.

10:52.902 --> 10:54.320
It's 30!

10:54.403 --> 10:55.821
Kidding.

10:56.697 --> 10:58.324
Keep it rolling on another car?

10:58.407 --> 11:02.620
Maybe a different line.
By now, someone's probably noticed.

11:02.703 --> 11:04.580
We should keep the risk to a minimum…

11:07.583 --> 11:08.834
How bad?

11:08.918 --> 11:10.503
Rookie mistake.

11:10.586 --> 11:14.090
Hasn't taken any precautions
since installing that implant.

11:14.173 --> 11:16.050
Which immunosuppressant is he on?

11:16.842 --> 11:18.469
He insured?

11:18.552 --> 11:21.847
No clue. Doesn't look like he would be.

11:21.931 --> 11:25.643
Any family or guardian? Anyone I can call?

11:25.726 --> 11:28.854
Dunno. Parents, I guess.

11:28.938 --> 11:30.731
He used to go to the Academy.

11:30.815 --> 11:34.068
Arasaka? No wonder he could afford this.

11:34.151 --> 11:36.112
Hold on…

11:37.071 --> 11:39.990
Hey. How ya feeling?

11:40.616 --> 11:42.326
I'm gonna be sick…

11:42.410 --> 11:44.245
Which immunosuppressant do you take?

11:44.954 --> 11:46.247
Immuno… what?

11:48.332 --> 11:49.750
Wow, man…

11:49.834 --> 11:51.085
You're psycho.

11:55.256 --> 11:57.133
Hey, we passed the…

11:57.216 --> 11:58.426
Oh my.

11:58.509 --> 12:02.388
Listen, choom, the kid's got
an implant that'll fetch a nice price.

12:02.471 --> 12:04.014
Just sit back, relax and--

12:04.098 --> 12:07.268
What? You cut a deal
with the Scavengers or something?

12:07.351 --> 12:10.020
Sit back or I'll take your chrome, too.

12:10.104 --> 12:11.564
Sorry, David.

12:11.647 --> 12:14.775
Looks like your cut's down to 20.

12:29.331 --> 12:30.875
Let's go!

12:49.351 --> 12:50.269
Whoops.

12:50.352 --> 12:53.439
Hey, not dying, are ya?

12:53.522 --> 12:54.773
Doc…

12:54.857 --> 12:55.941
Huh?

12:56.025 --> 12:58.527
Doc's clinic… Please… take…

13:08.662 --> 13:10.039
David, buddy…

13:10.122 --> 13:13.042
You look like shit.

13:13.125 --> 13:14.210
Thanks…

13:15.461 --> 13:16.921
How many times you use it?

13:17.004 --> 13:19.298
Six… No, eight?

13:19.381 --> 13:21.342
Jesus Henry Christ!

13:21.425 --> 13:24.136
A grown-ass man
couldn't take that punishment.

13:24.220 --> 13:26.222
I was fine…

13:26.305 --> 13:28.432
But then my nose popped a cork.

13:29.016 --> 13:32.186
This gonk didn't know about
immunosuppressants.

13:33.062 --> 13:35.189
Didn't see the need.

13:35.272 --> 13:39.276
Of course you didn't.
Just sell him the meds.

13:39.360 --> 13:42.279
Shit off the shelf's not gonna cut it.
It'll cost ya.

13:42.363 --> 13:43.781
You good for it?

13:43.864 --> 13:45.533
You charging me?

13:45.616 --> 13:49.787
Fucking right I am!
Ain't running no charity.

13:50.746 --> 13:51.956
How much'll these buy?

13:53.749 --> 13:54.917
Two days' worth.

13:56.210 --> 13:57.461
That's it?

13:57.545 --> 13:59.338
Plenty of other rippers out there.

13:59.421 --> 14:02.883
Of course, that might land you
back with the Scavs.

14:04.009 --> 14:05.970
Greedy bastard…

14:09.265 --> 14:11.976
You really don't want it gone?

14:12.059 --> 14:13.185
Nope.

14:13.852 --> 14:18.691
Still can't believe it…
Eight times in one goddamn day.

14:18.774 --> 14:20.985
You're either a total masochist or…

14:21.068 --> 14:26.615
Listen. Don't use it more than
two times a day. Three max.

14:26.699 --> 14:29.785
Even if your body can take it,
that egghead of yours can't.

14:29.869 --> 14:34.248
Your brain's gonna get scrambled.

14:35.374 --> 14:38.586
A single implant
could make me a cyberpsycho?

14:38.669 --> 14:42.172
Never heard anything like that before.

14:42.256 --> 14:43.507
Goes to show you…

14:43.591 --> 14:46.010
just how dangerous that thing is.

15:03.819 --> 15:05.029
All done?

15:05.112 --> 15:06.322
Yeah.

15:06.405 --> 15:08.866
Guess that's a wrap for today.

15:08.949 --> 15:10.701
I can keep going.

15:10.784 --> 15:15.039
No way, I'm not babysitting a cyberpsycho.

15:15.623 --> 15:18.876
Only use the Sandevistan
when you really need to.

15:18.959 --> 15:20.794
Lots of other ways to churn out eds.

15:21.712 --> 15:24.006
Still willing to work with me
after all that?

15:24.089 --> 15:26.926
Think I'd let you go
without being paid back first?

15:29.845 --> 15:32.556
Well, good. I need the eddies.

15:32.640 --> 15:33.849
That's the spirit.

15:35.517 --> 15:40.064
Sure you're not up for more tonight?
I'm kinda lagging on rent.

15:40.147 --> 15:42.858
No more today. Quit asking.

15:43.525 --> 15:44.902
Okay…

15:48.447 --> 15:49.448
Come with me.

15:49.531 --> 15:51.450
I knew you wanted to!

15:51.533 --> 15:53.285
Not work-related.

15:53.911 --> 15:54.870
Huh?

15:56.497 --> 15:57.498
Right here.

15:57.581 --> 16:00.209
You, uh… live alone?

16:00.292 --> 16:01.377
Yeah?

16:02.127 --> 16:02.962
Huh.

16:04.505 --> 16:06.173
Wait, are you nervous?

16:06.256 --> 16:07.091
No.

16:07.633 --> 16:08.759
Your first time?

16:08.842 --> 16:09.760
No.

16:11.261 --> 16:12.471
Hey, fuck off!

16:13.263 --> 16:14.223
Take a seat.

16:15.015 --> 16:16.892
I've only got beer. You drink?

16:16.976 --> 16:18.477
Uh, yeah.

16:18.560 --> 16:19.728
Cheers.

16:28.320 --> 16:31.865
Seriously? You've never drunk before?

16:31.949 --> 16:33.993
No, I have. It's just…

16:34.868 --> 16:37.246
I don't like carbonated drinks or smokes.

16:37.871 --> 16:39.915
Do people like that really exist?

16:39.999 --> 16:41.250
I'm not lying.

16:41.333 --> 16:44.169
Sure you aren't.
And what's up with that getup anyway?

16:47.798 --> 16:48.674
Take it off.

16:48.757 --> 16:50.217
What? Why?

16:50.300 --> 16:52.219
Just do it. Come on.

16:52.302 --> 16:53.137
H-Hey!

16:57.099 --> 16:58.851
Don't mess with that…

17:01.061 --> 17:02.688
Edgerunners?

17:02.771 --> 17:05.149
It's another word for cyberpunk.

17:05.232 --> 17:07.026
It's who you wanna be, right?

17:08.277 --> 17:11.030
I'm actually a fan of JK's
"EDGERUNNERS" series.

17:12.239 --> 17:13.282
You serious?

17:14.616 --> 17:15.784
Look who's talking.

17:15.868 --> 17:18.662
What's up with that tacky poster?

17:20.205 --> 17:21.165
You got a problem?

17:21.248 --> 17:25.044
Uh… no problem.

17:25.669 --> 17:29.923
Just always whacked me how those ads
make it seem like some kind of paradise.

17:30.007 --> 17:33.427
I mean, lots of peeps died trying to
turn that dumb rock into something useful.

17:34.011 --> 17:36.055
Sounds more like a prison than paradise.

17:37.181 --> 17:38.807
Sounds like someone did their homework.

17:40.017 --> 17:43.979
The Academy teaches you things
they don't show in the ads.

17:44.063 --> 17:47.024
As expected of a preppy Academy boy.

17:47.649 --> 17:49.443
It's not like that.

17:49.526 --> 17:52.321
Isn't it? Never caught a pleb
attending a 'Saka school.

17:52.404 --> 17:53.530
It's not!

17:57.367 --> 18:00.454
My mom and I, we weren't well off.

18:00.537 --> 18:03.332
The Academy normally
wouldn't have taken me.

18:04.083 --> 18:08.712
But my mom had to work real
damn hard to keep me in.

18:09.379 --> 18:14.093
You wanna know the kicker though?
I knew from day one that I'd never belong.

18:14.176 --> 18:17.554
Then why did you stick around for so long?

18:17.638 --> 18:22.559
Good fucking question. Guess it's 'cause
Mom wanted me to get a 'Saka job,

18:22.643 --> 18:24.478
climb the corporate ladder…

18:24.561 --> 18:29.566
That was her wish… Or dream, I guess.

18:29.650 --> 18:31.360
That's why.

18:32.319 --> 18:34.822
That's not your dream, though.

18:34.905 --> 18:35.739
Not my dream?

18:36.323 --> 18:38.992
Well, yeah. You and your mom
are two different people.

18:39.910 --> 18:42.329
Why should you need to work for her dream?

18:43.163 --> 18:45.749
There's nothing wrong with that.

18:45.833 --> 18:48.127
You have to find your own dream.

18:48.669 --> 18:51.505
Sounds like you've found yours.

18:53.382 --> 18:54.508
You're joking.

18:54.591 --> 18:59.805
You called it a prison, but to me,
this city is a whole lot worse.

19:00.430 --> 19:01.598
Here?

19:02.349 --> 19:04.768
I just wanna go away as far as possible.

19:08.021 --> 19:09.481
Lemme show you something.

19:24.913 --> 19:27.666
Whoa! Check the resolution on this!

19:27.749 --> 19:29.668
I can feel the fucking sun!

19:29.751 --> 19:33.672
It connects through your personal link
to let you feel the sun's heat.

19:33.755 --> 19:36.925
Of course, you'd burn to a crisp
if it was the real temperature,

19:37.009 --> 19:40.429
so I made sure to tweak it down.

19:41.305 --> 19:42.306
Want me to change it back?

19:42.389 --> 19:44.308
No, this is fun!

19:45.559 --> 19:46.810
You look ridiculous!

19:53.400 --> 19:54.526
Pretty cool, huh?

19:54.610 --> 19:56.236
This is amazing!

19:56.320 --> 19:57.362
Isn't it?

19:59.698 --> 20:00.824
Over here.

21:28.620 --> 21:31.331
First time I've ever shown anyone this.

21:31.415 --> 21:33.166
Oh… really?

21:34.710 --> 21:38.380
So, like… why me?

21:39.172 --> 21:43.427
No idea. Guess it just felt right.

21:45.804 --> 21:47.097
You know…

21:47.723 --> 21:49.683
I think we'd make a good team.

21:51.226 --> 21:52.644
Yeah…

22:07.451 --> 22:08.285
Huh?

22:10.412 --> 22:14.249
Hate to break it to ya,
but that implant belongs to me.

22:15.000 --> 22:17.127
I'll be taking it back now.
